This project contains a TypeScript port of the scheduler, KV cache manager,
block pool, async scheduler and related components of vLLM
(https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm), pinned to commit
adc3e03517d2e7333a3bb2083bb4d394a2986876. Class, method and field names
mirror the upstream source. vLLM is licensed under the Apache License 2.0,
